			<li>For those who want to beat their friends in Fantasy Premier League</li>
			<li>Implemented an ensemble of machine learning models (XGBoost, Random Forest, Linear Regression) to predict expected FPL points for all players every gameweek</li>
			</ul>
			<div class="icon-links">
				<a href="https://github.com/achoi25" aria-label="GitHub">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-github" size={22} />
				</a>
				<a href="mailto:alcachoice@gmail.com" aria-label="Email">
					<Icon name="tabler:mail" size={22} />
				</a>
				<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/andrewchoij" aria-label="LinkedIn">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-linkedin" size={22} />
				</a>
			</div>
		</main>
